		<a href="mailto:info@d-wie-demokratie.de?subject=Unterst%C3%BCtzung%20D%20wie%20Demokratie">info@d-wie-demokratie.de</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7.5vw, 2.75rem);
	}
</style>
